#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "128_Shifty Man"
msgid "Hey there, buddy. Not too often I see guys like you down\\r\nin a place like this."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "140_Shifty Man"
msgid "Let me guess. You're concerned about the slow deterioration\\r\nof our natural environment, so you've come to me, the expert on all things grassy and green."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "152_Player"
msgid "Uh... Actually, I..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "164_Shifty Man"
msgid "Relax, big guy. I won't bite. But I will drop a big old\\r\nknowledge bomb on you."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "176_Shifty Man"
msgid "You know how much trash gets collected in Kamurocho in a\\r\nyear? 22,000 tons. 60 tons every single day. That's as much\\r\nas two humpback whales! Every day!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "188_Shifty Man"
msgid "And that doesn't include the litter strewn around town that\\r\nnobody bothers to pick up. Which, trust me, is a lot."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "200_Shifty Man"
msgid "So, I've devoted my life to making this city as clean as\\r\npossible."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "212_Shifty Man"
msgid "Yes!"
msgstr "¡Sí!"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "224_Player"
msgid "...And?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "236_Man"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr "¿Mm?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "248_Player"
msgid "What's any of this have to do with me?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "260_Shifty Man"
msgid "Oh! Right!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "272_Shifty Man"
msgid "'Round here they call me the Mean Green Machine! No matter\\r\nhow high that trash stacks, I'll always be there to whisk it away!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "284_Mean Green Machine"
msgid "Speaking of, trash has something of a special value down\\r\nhere in the underground."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "296_Player"
msgid "What do you mean... value?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "308_Mean Green Machine"
msgid "You heard me! Down here, trash makes the world go 'round!\\r\nDitch your cash, bring me some trash!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "320_Mean Green Machine"
msgid "I'll appraise whatever bits of trash you give me, and give\\r\nyou the appropriate number of points. Points are like our\\r\nmoney, mind you."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "332_Mean Green Machine"
msgid "Here, take this."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "368_Mean Green Machine"
msgid "With points, you can buy all sorts of stuff. Items, food,\\r\nequipment. Though of course, this only applies to the shops\\r\nwe run down in these here sewers."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "380_Mean Green Machine"
msgid "Oh, and keep in mind any trash you've got is worthless until\\r\nI get my hands on it. Don't worry, I won't rip you off or\\r\nnothing."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "392_Mean Green Machine"
msgid "One more thing! Just 'cause you nab a piece of trash, that\\r\ndoesn't mean it's gone forever. Someone's bound to litter\\r\nagain in the same spot if you wait long enough."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "404_Mean Green Machine"
msgid "Anyway, why don't you start with that little speck of smut\\r\nover there? Just bring it on over to me."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "428_Mean Green Machine"
msgid "Thanks for stopping by. What can I trash you for?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "452_Mean Green Machine"
msgid "Come back when you've got your hands on some more trash.\\r\nAnd don't forget to have a clean day!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "476_Mean Green Machine"
msgid "Come back when you've got your hands on some more trash.\\r\nAnd don't forget to have a clean day!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "488_Mean Green Machine"
msgid "If you say so. Have a clean day!"
msgstr ""

